"style":{"fontSize":"1.5rem","marginBottom":"1rem","color":"var(--text-color)"},"children":"3. Automatically Collected Information"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":"1.8"},"children":["$","p",null,{"children":"When you access our platform, we automatically collect certain information, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, and data about your interaction with our services."}]}]]}],["$","section","3",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.5rem","marginBottom":"1rem","color":"var(--text-color)"},"children":"4. How We Use Your Information"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":"1.8"},"children":["$","p",null,{"children":"We use the information we collect to provide, maintain, and improve our services, including our AI Assistant and business automations. We also use it to process transactions, send technical notices, and respond to customer service requests."}]}]]}],["$","section","4",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.5rem","marginBottom":"1rem","color":"var(--text-color)"},"children":"5. Data Sharing and Disclosure"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":"1.8"},"children":["$","p",null,{"children":"We do not sell your personal data. We may share your information with trusted third-party vendors, service providers, and subprocessors who need access to such information to carry out work on our behalf (e.g., payment processing, cloud hosting, and secure AI model inference)."}]}]]}],["$","section","5",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.5rem","marginBottom":"1rem","color":"var(--text-color)"},"children":"6. Data Retention and Deletion"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":"1.8"},"children":["$","p",null,{"children":"We store your personal data for as long as it is necessary to provide our services. You may request the deletion of your account and associated data at